WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.440
You know, you want order in here now, yet you stormed the director of Homeland Security, Kristi Noem.

00:05.740 --> 00:07.900
You sure didn't have order that day, did you, Senator?

00:08.000 --> 00:12.120
Attorney General, you are under oath I did not storm the secretary.

